{"root":{"data":{"id":"dma95wo8l2o0","created":1792559088130,"text":"工作清单","expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dma9itc73n40","created":1792560099605,"text":"紧急"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dma9is8j2vs0","created":1792560097207,"text":"待办","expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dma9jlwq06g0","created":1792560161796,"text":"ESP32（2.8inch）开发板"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dma9kqt50wg0","created":1792560250828,"text":"分支主题","expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dma9kyqyez40","created":1792560268110,"text":"ESP32-S3(2.8inch)开发板测试、检查核对，发给张工批量贴片","layout_right_offset":{"x":-117.49999533096968,"y":1.666666600439271}},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dma9krc1z940","created":1792560251972,"text":"分支主题"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dma9krpy3rs0","created":1792560252812,"text":"分支主题"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dma9ks2nqi00","created":1792560253580,"text":"分支主题"},"children":[]}]}]},{"data":{"id":"dma9jfqua1c0","created":1792560148380,"text":"已完成"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dma9klaovk00","created":1792560238828,"text":"分支主题"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dm10c1ymag80","created":1791620140227,"text":"待办：\n\n1. ESP32-S3(2.8inch)开发板测试、检查核对，发给张工批量贴片\n2. ESP32三麦克风板原理图推理，贴片测试线路板\n3. ES8311/ES7210音频处理模块单独画板，对接ESP32-S3\n4. ESP32-S3(2.8inch)开发板更换LCD,驱动引脚重新定义\n5. LCD屏幕驱动板抄板，用于ESP32-S3(2.8inch)开发板\n6. 汽车蓝牙板改板（蓝牙音响、功放方案选型），对接ESP32-S3开发板\n7. 仓库风扇板维修\n8. ESP32-S3（2.8inch）开发板采购屏幕\n9. USB20孔插排新方案选型\n10. 空气炸锅线路板工作原理梳理\n11. 涂鸦无线模组--画板（预留UART焊盘、I2C、IO口）\n12. ESP32-S3无线模组--画板（预留UART焊盘、I2C、IO口）\n13. 单独画模组（ESP32/涂鸦），外接天线、板载天线","priority":2,"layout":null,"font-size":18,"expandState":"expand","background":"#ffff00","font-weight":"bold"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dma56afgilc0","created":1792547833634,"text":"分支主题","layout":null},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dma56crukmg0","created":1792547838737,"text":"分支主题","expandState":"expand","layout":null},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dma573154p40","created":1792547895895,"text":"10.23-1030","layout":null},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dma56c4f7z40","created":1792547837320,"text":"分支主题","layout":null},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dma56cl7pts0","created":1792547838336,"text":"分支主题","layout":null},"children":[]}]}]},"template":"right","theme":"fresh-blue","version":"1.4.43"}